commit 23b2f549569406955a43f704f9ac91b2a49509db
Author: Jack Shelton <me@jackshelton.com>
Date:   Tue Aug 11 22:44:50 2026 -0500

    feat: opt-in file-input and download-capture witness mechanisms; tiny-translator schema

    Both mechanisms are per-AppSpec opt-ins with absence CHECKABLE: the
    context builder is now a pure exported function, a non-opted spec's
    options carry no acceptDownloads key at all, and a test walks all
    eleven existing verticals proving none declares either. File loads
    record path/name/bytes/sha256; downloads ledger
    suggestedFilename/bytes/sha256. Schema: per-lane seams (the critters
    inlining divergence as a declared difference), two distinct mat-icon
    degradations checked against measured resolved families, declared
    style differences checked both directions (stale declarations fail),
    bound build receipts re-reading their x2 siblings' byte-identity,
    0-manual-step framing with the 9-file/5-capability inventory and the
    FileReader parity obligation named. 44 tests; 1894/1894.

